;
; How Witness files an entry of its audit record, in MYRA (witness_rules.h
; WR3): its index (zxvd's seq), the index of the entry before it, its kind
; (witness_model.h WITNESS_CHANGE .. WITNESS_OTHER) and its stamp, ms
; since 1970. Witness asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXWIT(seq:i18) = prev:i18! ^ kind:i1! ^ stamp:i15!
